CrossArea_subclass', clusters PAX\")\n35027: AnnotationAssertion(obo:RO_0002175 obo:CL_4072036 obo:NCBITaxon_9606)\n35028: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072036 \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5507-2103\")\n35029: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072036 \"2025-09-10T08:47:34Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35030: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11165918\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4072036 \"The marker set RELN, HCRTR2 can identify the Human cell type PAX6 GABAergic interneuron in the neocortex with a confidence of 0.724125093 (NS-Forest FBeta value).\")\n35031: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072036 \"PAX6 GABAergic interneuron (Homo sapiens)\")\n35032: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072036 obo:CL_4042032)\n35033: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072036 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_9606))\n35034: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072036 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0015004 obo:CLM_1000079))\n35035: \n35036: # Class: obo:CL_4072037 (L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Homo sapiens))\n35037: \n35038: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4072037 \"L2/3 IT (Homo sapiens)\")\n35039: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25622573\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34004146\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37292694\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/c3aa4f95-7a18-4a7d-8dd8-ca324d714363.cxg/\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072037 \"A transcriptomically distinct intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic neuron with a soma found between cortical layer 2-4. This intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic neuron has thin-tufted apical dendrites and extends its axonal projection into L5 in the neocortex. This neuronal type has a hyperpolarised resting membrane potential. The standard transcriptomic reference data for this cell type can be found on the CellxGene census under the collection: 'Transcriptomic cytoarchitecture reveals principles of human neocortex organization', dataset: 'Supercluster: IT-projecting excitatory neurons', Author Categories: 'CrossArea_subclass', clusters L2/3 IT.\")\n35040: AnnotationAssertion(obo:RO_0002175 obo:CL_4072037 obo:NCBITaxon_9606)\n35041: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072037 \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5507-2103\")\n35042: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072037 \"2025-09-10T09:15:51Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35043: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_4072037 \"ILX:0770156\")\n35044: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34004146\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072037 \"L2/3 IT (Homo sapiens)\")\n35045: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:inSubset obo:CL_4072037 cl:cellxgene_subset)\n35046: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11165918\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4072037 \"The marker set ONECUT2, COL5A2 can identify the Human cell type L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron in the neocortex with a confidence of 0.670149932 (NS-Forest FBeta value).\")\n35047: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072037 \"L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Homo sapiens)\")\n35048: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072037 obo:CL_4030059)\n35049: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072037 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_9606))\n35050: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072037 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0015004 obo:CLM_1000065))\n35051: \n35052: # Class: obo:CL_4072038 (L5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Homo sapiens))\n35053: \n35054: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4072038 \"L5 IT (Homo sapiens)\")\n35055: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37292694\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37609206\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/c3aa4f95-7a18-4a7d-8dd8-ca324d714363.cxg/\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072038 \"An intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic neuron with a soma found in cortical layer 5. The standard transcriptomic reference data for this cell type can be found on the CellxGene census under the collection: 'Transcriptomic cytoarchitecture reveals principles of human neocortex organization', dataset: 'Supercluster: IT-projecting excitatory neurons', Author Categories: 'CrossArea_subclass', L5 IT.\")\n35056: AnnotationAssertion(obo:RO_0002175 obo:CL_4072038 obo:NCBITaxon_9606)\n35057: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072038 \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5507-2103\")\n35058: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072038 \"2025-09-10T09:47:23Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35059: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_4072038 \"ILX:0770157\")\n35060: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37292694\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072038 \"L5 IT (Homo sapiens)\")\n35061: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:inSubset obo:CL_4072038 cl:cellxgene_subset)\n35062: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11165918\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4072038 \"The marker set ARSJ, RORB, KCNK2 can identify the Human cell type L5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron in the neocortex with a confidence of 0.764261336 (NS-Forest FBeta value).\")\n35063: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072038 \"L5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Homo sapiens)\")\n35064: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072038 obo:CL_4030064)\n35065: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072038 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_9606))\n35066: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072038 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0015004 obo:CLM_1000068))\n35067: \n35068: # Class: obo:CL_4072039 (L4 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Homo sapiens))\n35069: \n35070: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4072039 \"L4 IT (Homo sapiens)\")\n35071: Annotatio